            <h3 id="example-feed">Feed</h3>
            <div class="example-grid">
              <div class="example-step"><span class="example-label">What I see</span><p>In a Shopping account, products are disapproved or miscategorized. Best sellers barely serve.</p></div>
              <div class="example-step"><span class="example-label">The call</span><p>Fix titles, categories, and availability in the product feed before increasing Shopping spend.</p></div>
              <div class="example-step"><span class="example-label">Why it matters</span><p>The problem isn’t “Shopping doesn’t work for us.” The feed is the ad—and yours is broken.</p></div>
